        <mxCell id="93J55uzrMlVFubEZ8TCH-5" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=zain;fontSize=11;fontColor=light-dark(#000000,#FFFFFF);fontStyle=0;labelBackgroundColor=none;resizable=0;fillColor=default;strokeColor=default;" value="کارت رزرو | reserve card: a specific table that contains the useful information about the appointment&lt;br&gt;It&#39;s a kind of receipt&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;the data it contains:&lt;br&gt;1. name and kind of the organization&lt;br&gt;2. location of the organization&lt;br&gt;3. date and time of appo approval&lt;br&gt;4. date and time of the appo referal&lt;br&gt;5. appo Code&lt;br&gt;6. name/phone number of the customer&lt;br&gt;7. price of the service&lt;br&gt;8. QR code referring to the link of the reserve card:&lt;br&gt;9.Current condition of the appointment: Done, waiting, rejected,&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="210" width="500" x="-180" y="1020" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="93J55uzrMlVFubEZ8TCH-6" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=zain;fontSize=11;fontColor=light-dark(#000000,#FFFFFF);fontStyle=0;labelBackgroundColor=none;resizable=0;fillColor=default;strokeColor=default;" value="appo QR code: a generated QR code contains the link to the appointment reserve card.&#xa;-- if the business man scans it -&amp;gt; finds the appo in their schedule&#xa;-- if the customer scans it -&amp;gt; finds the appo in their profile" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="450" x="-180" y="1270" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="93J55uzrMlVFubEZ8TCH-7" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=zain;fontSize=11;fontColor=light-dark(#000000,#FFFFFF);fontStyle=0;labelBackgroundColor=none;resizable=0;fillColor=default;strokeColor=default;" value="کد نوبت | appointment Code: It&#39;s a code to find the appointment&#39;s reserve card&lt;br&gt;used to troubleshoot the issues&lt;br&gt;used to validate the customer&#39;s appointment" vertex="1">
